128 at every published Qwen 3.5\nsize, so the collective does not grow with the model.\n\nqkvz_pspec also had the sequence axis hardcoded replicated, which gathered\nthe full sequence onto every device.\n\nMeasured at 1,048,576 tokens on 64 v5p chips: 513 tokens/s/chip, 27.6% MFU.","timestamp":"2026-08-22T14:40:09Z","author":{"name":"Willis Zhang","email":"williszhang@google.com"},"committer":{"name":"Willis Zhang","email":"williszhang@google.com"}},"repository":{"id":607845880,"node_id":"R_kgDOJDr9-A","name":"maxtext","full_name":"AI-Hypercomputer/maxtext","private":false,"owner":{"login":"AI-Hypercomputer","id":181000646,"node_id":"O_kgDOCsnZxg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/181000646?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AI-Hypercomputer","html_url":"https://github.com/AI-Hypercomputer","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AI-Hypercomputer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AI-Hypercomputer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AI-Hypercomputer/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AI-Hypercomputer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AI-Hypercomputer/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AI-Hypercomputer/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AI-Hypercomputer/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AI-Hypercomputer/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AI-Hypercomputer/received_events","type":"Organization","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"html_url":"https://github.com/AI-Hypercomputer/maxtext","description":"A simple, performant, and scalable Jax LLM!","fork":false,"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AI-Hypercomputer/maxtext","forks_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AI-Hypercomputer/maxtext/forks","keys_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AI-Hypercomputer/maxtext/keys{/key_id}","collaborators_url":"https://api.